#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:12
msgid ""
"Chain Captain has a 240 x 240 display and three physical buttons. Its UI "
"supports **M5.Lcd** and **M5.Widgets**. **M5UI** is not supported."
msgstr ""
"Chain Captain 配备 240 x 240 显示屏和三个实体按键。其 UI 支持 "
"**M5.Lcd** 和 **M5.Widgets**，不支持 **M5UI**。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:16
msgid "UiFlow2 Example"
msgstr "UiFlow2 示例"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:19
#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:130
msgid "Button Counter"
msgstr "按键计数器"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:21
msgid "Open the |chain_captain_button_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |chain_captain_button_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:23
msgid ""
"This example registers click callbacks for all three physical buttons. "
"Press **BtnA**, **BtnB**, or **BtnC** to increment the corresponding "
"counter on the display. Each event is also written to the serial console."
msgstr ""
"此示例为三个实体按键注册点击回调。按下 **BtnA**、**BtnB** 或 "
"**BtnC**，显示屏上对应的计数器将加一，同时每次按键事件也会输出到串口控制台。"

