#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:36
#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:146
msgid "Audio Recording and Playback"
msgstr "音频录制与播放"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:38
msgid "Open the |chain_captain_audio_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |chain_captain_audio_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:40
msgid ""
"This example configures the recorder for 8 kHz, 16-bit audio and stores a"
" five-second recording as ``/flash/res/audio/test.amr``. Press **BtnA** "
"to start recording. The display shows a countdown, and playback starts "
"automatically when recording finishes."
msgstr ""
"此示例将录音器配置为 8 kHz、16 位音频，并将 5 秒录音保存为 "
"``/flash/res/audio/test.amr``。按下 **BtnA** 开始录音，显示屏显示倒计时，"
"录音结束后自动开始播放。"

