msgstr "chain_captain_audio_example.png"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:51
msgid ""
"The display changes between Stop, Recording, countdown, and Playing "
"states."
msgstr "显示屏会在停止、录音、倒计时和播放状态之间切换。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:54
#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:163
msgid "IMU and Magnetometer"
msgstr "IMU 与磁力计"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:56
msgid "Open the |chain_captain_imu_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |chain_captain_imu_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:58
msgid ""
"This example reads the accelerometer, gyroscope, and magnetometer every "
"100 ms. It converts acceleration to ``m/s^2`` and displays the X, Y, and "
"Z values for all three sensors."
msgstr ""
"此示例每 100 ms 读取一次加速度计、陀螺仪和磁力计数据，将加速度转换为 "
"``m/s^2``，并显示三个传感器的 X、Y、Z 轴数据。"

