msgid "|chain_captain_imu_example.png|"
msgstr "|chain_captain_imu_example.png|"

#: ../../source/refs/controllers.chain_captain.ref:8
msgid "chain_captain_imu_example.png"
msgstr "chain_captain_imu_example.png"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:68
msgid ""
"The display shows live Acc, Gyro, and Mag readings on the 240 x 240 "
"screen."
msgstr "240 x 240 显示屏实时显示 Acc、Gyro 和 Mag 数据。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:71
#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:180
msgid "Infrared Transmission and Reception"
msgstr "红外发射与接收"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:73
msgid "Open the |chain_captain_ir_rx_tx_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |chain_captain_ir_rx_tx_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:75
msgid ""
"This example receives infrared frames continuously and displays the "
"received address, data, and frame count. Press **BtnA** to increment the "
"transmit data value and send it using address ``8``. A short speaker tone"
" confirms startup and each received frame."
msgstr ""
"此示例持续接收红外帧，并显示接收地址、数据和帧计数。按下 **BtnA** 可将"
"发射数据值加一，并使用地址 ``8`` 发送。程序启动和每次收到红外帧时，扬声器"
"都会发出短提示音。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:82
msgid "|chain_captain_ir_rx_tx_example.png|"
msgstr "|chain_captain_ir_rx_tx_example.png|"

#: ../../source/refs/controllers.chain_captain.ref:9
msgid "chain_captain_ir_rx_tx_example.png"
msgstr "chain_captain_ir_rx_tx_example.png"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:86
msgid "The display shows the current TX address/data and the latest RX values."
msgstr "显示屏显示当前 TX 地址和数据，以及最新的 RX 数据。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:89
#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:198
msgid "Power Management"
msgstr "电源管理"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:91
msgid "Open the |chain_captain_power_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |chain_captain_power_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:93
msgid ""
"This example updates USB, battery, and external-output voltage once per "
"second. The battery value is green while charging, and the output state "
"is shown as ON or OFF."
msgstr ""
"此示例每秒更新一次 USB、电池和外部输出电压。充电时电池数值显示为绿色，"
"输出状态显示为 ON 或 OFF。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:97
msgid "**BtnA** enables or disables the external 5 V output."
msgstr "**BtnA** 用于启用或关闭外部 5 V 输出。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:98
msgid "**BtnB** enables or disables battery charging."
msgstr "**BtnB** 用于启用或关闭电池充电。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:102
msgid "|chain_captain_power_example.png|"
msgstr "|chain_captain_power_example.png|"

#: ../../source/refs/controllers.chain_captain.ref:10
msgid "chain_captain_power_example.png"
msgstr "chain_captain_power_example.png"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:106
msgid ""
"The display shows USB, battery, and output voltage together with charging"
" and output state."
msgstr "显示屏同时显示 USB、电池和输出电压，以及充电状态和输出状态。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:110
#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:214
msgid "Speaker Tone"
msgstr "扬声器音调"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:112
msgid "Open the |chain_captain_speaker_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |chain_captain_speaker_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:114
msgid ""
"This example starts at 600 Hz with speaker volume set to 90 percent. "
"Press **BtnA** to play the current frequency for 200 ms. A new random "
"frequency from 600 Hz to 1600 Hz is then selected and displayed for the "
"next press."
msgstr ""
"此示例以 600 Hz 启动，并将扬声器音量设为 90%。按下 **BtnA** 以当前频率"
"播放 200 ms，随后随机选择并显示一个 600 Hz 至 1600 Hz 的新频率，供下次"
"按键播放。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:120
msgid "|chain_captain_speaker_example.png|"
msgstr "|chain_captain_speaker_example.png|"

#: ../../source/refs/controllers.chain_captain.ref:11
msgid "chain_captain_speaker_example.png"
msgstr "chain_captain_speaker_example.png"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:124
msgid ""
"The display shows the frequency that will be played on the next BtnA "
"click."
msgstr "显示屏显示下一次按下 BtnA 时将播放的频率。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:127
msgid "MicroPython Example"
msgstr "MicroPython 示例"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:132
msgid ""
"This example registers click callbacks for BtnA, BtnB, and BtnC and "
"maintains an independent display counter for each button."
msgstr "此示例为 BtnA、BtnB 和 BtnC 注册点击回调，并为每个按键维护独立的显示计数器。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:135
#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:152
#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:168
#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:186
#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:203
#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:219
msgid "MicroPython Code Block:"
msgstr "MicroPython 代码："

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:143
msgid "The display shows independent counters for all three buttons."
msgstr "显示屏显示三个按键各自的独立计数值。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:148
msgid ""
"This example records five seconds of 8 kHz, 16-bit audio to "
"``/flash/res/audio/test.amr`` and automatically plays the file when "
"recording finishes. Press BtnA to start recording."
msgstr ""
"此示例将 5 秒的 8 kHz、16 位音频录制到 ``/flash/res/audio/test.amr``，"
"录音结束后自动播放文件。按下 BtnA 开始录音。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:160
msgid "The display shows the recording countdown and playback state."
msgstr "显示屏显示录音倒计时和播放状态。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:165
msgid ""
"This example reads accelerometer, gyroscope, and magnetometer data every "
"100 ms and updates the nine displayed axis values in place."
msgstr ""
"此示例每 100 ms 读取一次加速度计、陀螺仪和磁力计数据，并原位更新显示的九个"
"轴向数值。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:176
msgid ""
"The display shows live acceleration, angular velocity, and magnetic field"
" values for the X, Y, and Z axes."
msgstr "显示屏实时显示 X、Y、Z 轴的加速度、角速度和磁场数据。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:182
msgid ""
"This example registers an infrared receive callback and tracks received "
"address, data, and frame count. Press BtnA to increment and send the "
"transmit data value using address ``8``."
msgstr ""
"此示例注册红外接收回调，并记录接收地址、数据和帧计数。按下 BtnA 可将发射"
"数据值加一，并使用地址 ``8`` 发送。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:194
msgid ""
"The display shows live TX and RX values, and the speaker confirms "
"received frames with a short tone."
msgstr "显示屏实时显示 TX 和 RX 数据，扬声器通过短提示音确认收到红外帧。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:200
msgid ""
"This example monitors USB, battery, and external-output voltage. BtnA "
"toggles the external 5 V output, while BtnB toggles battery charging."
msgstr ""
"此示例监测 USB、电池和外部输出电压。BtnA 用于切换外部 5 V 输出，BtnB "
"用于切换电池充电。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:211
msgid "The display shows voltage, charging state, and external-output state."
msgstr "显示屏显示电压、充电状态和外部输出状态。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:216
msgid ""
"This example plays a 200 ms speaker tone when BtnA is clicked, then "
"selects and displays a new random frequency between 600 Hz and 1600 Hz."
msgstr ""
"此示例在点击 BtnA 时播放 200 ms 的扬声器音调，随后在 600 Hz 至 1600 Hz "
"之间随机选择并显示一个新频率。"

#: ../../source/controllers/chain-captain.rst:227
msgid "The display shows the next tone frequency."
msgstr "显示屏显示下一次播放的音调频率。"
